## 4. Phased workplan

### Phase −1 — Pre-work (user action items)

- [ ] <downloads, subscriptions, access>

### Phase 0 — Triage

- [ ] Parse every filed return for in-scope years (use `parsing.md` 1065-Return / 1120-Return / 1120-S-Return schemas).
- [ ] Parse every K-1 and 1099 received.
- [ ] Parse every IRS letter on file.
- [ ] Inventory bank/brokerage accounts for every year.
- [ ] Pull IRS transcripts per `scenarios/irs-transcripts.md`.

### Phase 1 — Roster & labeling audit

- [ ] Verify K-1 recipient entity matches subscription docs (regarded owner, not SMLLC).
- [ ] Verify GP vs. LP character matches standing structure (see `entities/disregarded.md` dual-K-1 rule).
- [ ] Update entity.md roster to match observed reality.

### Phase 2 — Books reconstruction

Per year, build full workpaper set per `reconciliation.md`:
- [ ] Bank / brokerage / intercompany recs.
- [ ] Upstream K-1 pickup pivot (per `reconciliation.md` §8a).
- [ ] Capital accounts (tax basis) per partner / stock + debt basis per SH.
- [ ] Schedule L rollforward.
- [ ] Schedule M-1 / M-2.
- [ ] §199A Statement A pickup per upstream trade or business.
- [ ] Partner 1040 cross-check.

### Phase 3 — Variance & tax-impact quantification

- [ ] Dollar impact per year × partner × character.
- [ ] IRS-matching exposure assessment.
- [ ] Character-shift impact (LTCG/ordinary, §199A, NIIT, SE tax).

### Phase 4 — Amendment decision

Use decision framework per `scenarios/amend-partnership.md` or equivalent. Output: amend / work-around decision per year with authority.

### Phase 5 — Execution (only if authorized)

- [ ] Draft AAR / 1065-X / amended K-1s / partner 1040-Xs per `scenarios/amend-partnership.md`.
- [ ] <CPA / user> review gate.

### Phase 6 — Upstream K-1 corrections

- [ ] Request corrected K-1s from issuers where titling was wrong (Reg §1.6031(b)-1T).
- [ ] Substitute K-1 via Form 8082 (Notice 2008-14) where issuer refuses.

### Phase 7 — Penalty abatement

Per `scenarios/penalty-abatement.md` — Rev. Proc. 84-35 → FTA → reasonable cause → Form 843.

### Phase 8 — Forward-looking process

- [ ] Populate `books/chart-of-accounts.md` + `books/opening-balances.md`.
- [ ] Install perpetual capital-accounts ledger.
- [ ] Install K-1 intake SOP (60-second check at receipt).
- [ ] Install quarterly close cadence per `quarterly.md`.

