## 7. Pressure test before starting

A 2-hour sanity check before committing to full reconstruction:
1. Parse the most recent filed return; note Sch K line totals.
2. Sum the same boxes across received K-1s and direct activity.
3. Delta within 10% → surgical remediation. Delta >50% → structural rebuild.

